%% Bug report:
%% After saving changes to a patient's care plan, the dashboard occasionally
%% shows the old care plan. Refreshing the page a few seconds later shows the
%% updated care plan. Reported by 3 nurses on the night shift.

%% Root cause:
%% Saving the care plan triggers an asynchronous cache invalidation/update
%% process. The save request returns before the invalidation completes, creating
%% a race condition between the dashboard reading cached data and the cache being
%% refreshed. If the dashboard reloads before invalidation finishes, it displays
%% stale data. A later refresh succeeds because the cache has since been updated.

%% =====================================================
%% Initial complaint
%% =====================================================

B1["After saving changes to a patient's care plan, the dashboard occasionally shows the old care plan. Refreshing the page fixes it. Reported by 3 nurses on the night shift."]

%% =====================================================
%% Initial hypotheses
%% =====================================================

H1["Write error?"]
H2["Cache invalidation?"]

B1 -->|supports| H1
B1 -->|supports| H2

%% =====================================================
%% Investigating H1 — write error
%% =====================================================

A1["Check logs for write errors"]
H1 -->|motivates| A1

O1["No write errors in logs"]
A1 -->|produces| O1

O1 -->|weakens| H1

%% =====================================================
%% Investigating H2 — cache invalidation
%% =====================================================

A2["Get details from nurse — what specifically did she change?"]
H2 -->|motivates| A2

A3["Check database for event row"]
A2 -->|enables| A3

O2["Event exists in database"]
A3 -->|produces| O2

%% =====================================================
%% Evidence updates hypotheses
%% =====================================================

O2 -->|refutes| H1
O2 -->|supports| H2

%% =====================================================
%% Investigating cache invalidation mechanism
%% =====================================================

A4["Investigate cache invalidation mechanism"]
H2 -->|motivates| A4

O3["Job runs that invalidates cache on main care plan updated_at field"]
A4 -->|produces| O3

H3["Race condition: update returns before job finsishes"]
O3 --> |suggests| H3

H3 --> |motivates| A5

A5["Reproduce by going quickly to dashboard, while monitoring cache invalidation job, then refresh"]
A5 --> |confirms| H3
